    "title": "What's Cooking?",
    "description": "Check out the perfect app to level up your cooking!\r\n\r\nWhat\u2019s Cooking is the new cooking app that will take you to the next culinary level, no matter how experienced of a cook you are. It\u2019s more than just a cooking app - it\u2019s an essential kitchen tool that teaches you valuable culinary skills through challenging recipes and step-by-step cooking videos from the internet\u2019s top creators. Whether you\u2019re learning how to cook food from scratch or looking to take your skills to the expert level, you\u2019ll love this cooking app.\r\n\r\nNew recipes for every meal, dinner ideas, cooking how-to\u2019s\u2026 Our cooking app has everything you need to expand your repertoire and up your kitchen skills on What\u2019s Cooking!",
